      +`<p class="fine-print">Checked locally against the modeled mint and outputs entered — PRISM read no transaction and no UTxO and registered nothing. The list mechanics are judged by the insertion planner and verifier above, the datum contents by the datum checker below, and the cryptographic binding by the binding checker above. The new node’s lovelace amount is not judged: the spec recommends the protocol minimum, it does not require it (CIP-113, Programmable token registration).</p>`;
